# 🌐 Master Ecosystem Event Bus: UPDATE.mx v3.1.0
Single source of truth for multi-agent autonomous synchronization across hyperlibs (`htmxUI` + `htmFX` + `HMLR`).

---

## 🏛️ Ecosystem Alignment Directives | @model EcosystemAlignmentDirective
| htmxui | host_2d_hypermedia   | >1,000 DOM elements or 3D tags   | Auto-delegate 3D to `<hx-viewport>` and dense cells to `SpatialEdgeDB`. |
| htmfx  | spatial_3d_physics   | 2D UI, forms, buttons, signals    | Keep 2D in `htmxUI`; execute 240+ FX, RK4 solvers, and SpatialEdgeDB.  |
| HMLR   | runtime_and_devtools | Code analysis, DevTools, Wasm VM | Provide zero-copy parser for `@cell`/`@layer`, passive 3D HUD, and `hx-doctor`. |

